WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.292
A person crosses open ground between two trimmed trees and a cluster of low buildings.

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:05.750
Two children move across a courtyard beside a woven fence hung with clothes.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.458
A smiling child in a patterned headscarf faces the camera while people gather behind.

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:10.208
A child in a light-blue tunic stands in the foreground of a courtyard.

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:12.333
People gather beneath trees in a courtyard, with two adults in the foreground.

00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:15.958
Children stand on open ground beside a tree and low buildings.

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:18.167
Children fill the frame, including one in a red head covering.

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:21.875
People stand in a close group around a large metal vessel.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:24.583
A wide view of open ground, low buildings and trees, with two figures in the foreground.
